Fuzz workspace (development/verification only)
----------------------------------------------

The isolated `fuzz/` workspace is a build/verification harness and is not part
of a released HPSI binary. Its only normal dependency, `libfuzzer-sys` (0.4.x),
is declared `(MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND NCSA`; it also pulls `arbitrary` (normal)
and `cc` (build). Those obligations apply only when the fuzz targets are built
locally; none of those crates is redistributed in the HPSI toolkit artifact.

